<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Bearman to increase share capital.</title>
<headline>Bearman to increase share capital.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bearing Man Ltd said on Friday it planned to increase its share capital in the ratio of nine new ordinary shares for every one held to improve its tradability.</p>
<p>The additional shares will be listed on February 24, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
